---
import PageRail from './PageRail.astro';
import Img from './Img.astro';
import CaseHeroMockup from './CaseHeroMockup.astro';
import {caseBy} from '../data/site';
const study=caseBy('miami-tactical');
---
<article class="miami-case">
  <header class="zn-page-hero miami-hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div><p class="kick">ZINC / Website + logo design</p><h1 class="disp">Miami<br/>Tactical<span>.</span></h1><p class="lede">A distinct mark.<br/>A direct digital presence.</p><a href="#overview" class="arrow">Explore the project ↓</a></div>
      <div class="identity-stage"><span class="stage-label">Identity / Miami Tactical</span><Img k="miami-tactical-logo" alt="Miami Tactical logo: a circular crosshair beside the wordmark" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 50vw" /><span class="stage-foot">Black. White. A clear point of focus.</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>
  <PageRail path="/work/miami-tactical/" title="Miami Tactical" />
  <nav class="case-jumps wrap" aria-label="Miami Tactical case study sections"><a href="#overview">Overview</a><a href="#website">Website</a><a href="#logo">Logo design</a><a href="#design-details">Design details</a></nav>
  <section id="overview" class="case-section"><div class="wrap overview-grid"><div><p class="kick">01 / The project</p><h2 class="disp">A focused<br/>foundation.</h2></div><div><p class="intro">ZINC designed the Miami Tactical logo and website, giving the name a simple visual identity and a place on screen.</p><p>The work pairs a geometric mark with straightforward typography. On the website, a black-and-white foundation gives the photography room to lead, while search and category navigation sit clearly above it.</p><dl class="scope"><div><dt>Client</dt><dd>Miami Tactical</dd></div><div><dt>Work</dt><dd>Website · Logo design</dd></div></dl></div></div></section>
  <section id="website" class="case-section website-section" data-case-pages="miami-tactical"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kick">02 / Website design</p><h2 class="disp">On screen.</h2></div><p>A bold opening image and a practical header give the page two clear jobs: establish the brand and help visitors find their way.</p></div><div class="website-stage"><CaseHeroMockup study={study} loading="lazy" /></div><div class="detail-grid"><div><span class="detail-number">01</span><h3>A clear starting point</h3><p>The logo anchors the header. Search takes a prominent position alongside the account and cart controls.</p></div><div><span class="detail-number">02</span><h3>Categories in view</h3><p>A separate navigation strip makes the main categories visible before the visitor reaches the opening image.</p></div><div><span class="detail-number">03</span><h3>Photography with presence</h3><p>The monochrome photograph fills the opening section. A dark overlay holds the headline and supporting text together.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section id="logo" class="case-section logo-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kick">03 / Logo design</p><h2 class="disp">The mark<br/>and the name.</h2></div><p>A circular crosshair and an open, uppercase wordmark. The identity stays deliberately spare, with the symbol doing the visual work.</p></div><figure class="logo-board"><Img k="miami-tactical-logo" alt="Original Miami Tactical black logo on white" sizes="90vw" /><figcaption>Miami Tactical / Primary logo</figcaption></figure><div class="logo-notes"><div><h3>A geometric focal point</h3><p>Concentric circles and intersecting lines form the emblem. Its compact shape balances the long horizontal name.</p></div><div><h3>Room around the wordmark</h3><p>Clean letterforms and generous spacing keep the name readable. The horizontal arrangement gives the icon and typography their own space.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section id="design-details" class="case-section design-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="kick">04 / Visual language</p><h2 class="disp">Contrast<br/>with purpose.</h2></div><p>Black and white carry the identity. On the website, restrained red accents distinguish utility links without competing with the main image.</p></div><div class="palette" aria-label="Website palette: black, white and red"><div class="swatch swatch-black"><span>Black</span><small>Header &amp; typography</small></div><div class="swatch swatch-white"><span>White</span><small>Space &amp; contrast</small></div><div class="swatch swatch-red"><span>Red</span><small>Utility accents</small></div></div><div class="closing-note"><p class="kick">The completed scope</p><p>A logo and a website, connected through a simple monochrome identity.</p><a class="arrow" href="/work/felon-motorwerk/">Next project / Felon Motorwerk ↗</a></div></div></section>
</article>
<style>
.miami-case{background:#f2f2ef;color:#151515;--ink:#151515;--muted:#54575a;--line:#d1d3d4}.miami-hero{padding:80px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 50%,#341415 0,transparent 55%),#090b0d;color:#f8f8f6}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.miami-hero h1{font-size:clamp(72px,9vw,144px);line-height:.94;margin:28px 0}.miami-hero h1 span{color:#d84040}.miami-hero .kick{color:#bec0c3}.miami-hero a{color:#f8f8f6}.lede{font-size:clamp(21px,2vw,28px);line-height:1.4;color:#ccc}.identity-stage{min-height:330px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:45px;padding:35px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#222426,#101112);border:1px solid #3c3c3c;box-shadow:0 28px 60px #0005;transform:rotate(-3deg)}.identity-stage :global(img){display:block;width:100%;height:auto;filter:invert(1);mix-blend-mode:screen}.stage-label,.stage-foot{font:11px/1.6 var(--fm);color:#c0c0c0}.stage-foot{align-self:flex-end}.case-jumps{display:flex;gap:16px 32px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-block:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc}.case-jumps a{font:12px/1.5 var(--fm);padding:8px 0;color:#222}.case-section{padding:84px 0;scroll-margin-top:90px;border-bottom:1px solid #d5d5d2}.case-section h2{font-size:clamp(50px,6vw,90px);line-height:1;margin:18px 0 28px;color:inherit}.case-section p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;max-width:55ch}.case-section .kick{font:11px/1.6 var(--fm);color:inherit}.overview-grid,.section-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px}.section-head{align-items:end;margin-bottom:38px}.section-head>p{margin-bottom:30px}.case-section .intro{font-size:25px;line-height:1.5}.scope{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:30px;padding-top:24px;margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #ccc}.scope dt{font:11px var(--fm);color:#626262;margin-bottom:10px}.scope dd{margin:0;font-size:15px}.website-section{background:#fff}.website-stage{padding:5% 8% 2%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#fff,#edeff0);border:1px solid #ddd}.website-stage :global(.case-mockup){margin:0}.detail-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px;margin-top:48px}.detail-number{font:12px var(--fm);color:#626262}.case-section h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;margin:14px 0}.detail-grid p,.logo-notes p{font-size:16px}.logo-board{margin:0;padding:9% 6% 3%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6d6d6}.logo-board :global(img){width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.logo-board figcaption{margin-top:9%;font:11px/1.5 var(--fm);color:#666}.logo-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;margin-top:35px}.design-section{background:#191b1d;color:#f5f5f2}.palette{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1.4fr 1fr;border:1px solid #555}.swatch{min-height:210px;padding:25px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.swatch span{font-size:25px}.swatch small{font:11px/1.6 var(--fm)}.swatch-black{background:#080808;color:#fff}.swatch-white{background:#fff;color:#111}.swatch-red{background:#970b0b;color:#fff}.closing-note{margin-top:60px;max-width:750px}.closing-note>p:not(.kick){font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.35}.closing-note a{color:#fff}.miami-case a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #00b7ba;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:800px){.hero-grid,.overview-grid,.section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.miami-hero{padding:45px 0 55px}.identity-stage{transform:none;min-height:240px;padding:24px;margin-top:20px}.case-section{padding:50px 0}.section-head{margin-bottom:25px}.section-head>p{margin:0}.detail-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.detail-grid>div{padding-bottom:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}.logo-notes{gap:24px;grid-template-columns:1fr}.website-stage{padding:6% 2% 2%}.swatch{min-height:170px;padding:16px}.swatch span{font-size:20px}.swatch small{font-size:10px}.case-section .intro{font-size:22px}}@media(max-width:420px){.palette{grid-template-columns:1fr}.swatch{min-height:115px;flex-direction:row;align-items:end}.swatch small{max-width:16ch;text-align:right}}
</style>
